<title>USA: Unisys Corp to redeem 8.875 percent notes.</title>
<headline>Unisys Corp to redeem 8.875 percent notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisys Corp said on Friday it would redeem on November 4 its $135 million in outstanding 8.875 percent notes due July 15, 1997, at 100 percent of the principal amount, plus accrued interest.</p>
<p>The redemption follows Unisys Corp's sucessful completion of its $450 million eight-year debt offering via underwriters Bear Stearns &amp; Co and BT Securities Corp.</p>
<p>--Corporate Bond unit, 212-859-1675</p>
</text>
